      "role": "user",
      "content": "hi, i'm looking for some clarification on how inheritance tax works for assets held in different jurisdictions. specifically, if a deceased individual was a UK resident but held significant real estate in Spain and liquid assets in a US-based brokerage account, how is the global estate typically treated for UK IHT purposes?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
